1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:07,200
[ENVIRONMENT] Sahrin, before dawn. Old Market is already moving.

2
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:11,950
[RADIO] Multiple failures. Power, roads, and command.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:15,900
[RADIO] Command channel is silent. Reports conflict.

4
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:19,200
[DALIA] Survivors found. Extracting.

5
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,950
[SAMIRA] Civilians cut off beyond the clinic road.

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:26,400
[ARIA] Civic Relay online. System integrity partial.

7
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:31,300
[ARIA] Emergency continuity search. One valid authority found.

8
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:35,900
[ARIA] Old Market. Civilian access is compromised.

9
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,900
[ARIA] Select a Commander identity, or continue with the default.

10
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:46,100
[ARIA] Commander confirmed. Give me one bounded order.

11
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:49,100
[ARIA] Guidance can be changed later.

12
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:54,950
[ARIA] Power, roads, and command links are failing.

13
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:59,450
[DALIA] Two JRC squads responding. Forward post dark.

14
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,500
[SAMIRA] Families and crews remain beyond the clinic.

15
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:07,700
[ARIA] Coordination is probable. Attribution remains uncertain.

16
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:11,500
[COMMANDER] Connect responders. Protect the corridor.

17
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:14,400
[DALIA] Confirmed armed patrol approaching Old Market.

18
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:20,400
[ARIA] Three hostiles confirmed. Civilians remain behind the barrier.

19
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:24,450
[DALIA] Field units are ready. Tactical control is yours.

20
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:28,200
[ARIA] Move to cover. Secure the corridor.

21
00:01:28,550 --> 00:01:30,300
[REVIEW] M01 gameplay handoff placeholder.

22
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:33,600
[SAMIRA] The route is open. Responders are moving.

23
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:39,100
[ARIA] Orders share a timing pattern. Credential trace incomplete.

24
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:42,600
[DALIA] A second cell is moving toward the abandoned post.

25
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:48,100
[ARIA] District coordination restored. Awaiting your next command.
